<ArticleLayout
	title="Contact — Semantic Signal LLM Trader"
	description="Contact Piotr Kurnicki (@qrak): email contact@qrak.org, GitHub, Discord community, or the live dashboard."
	meta="Contact"
>
	<span slot="title">Contact</span>
	<p slot="subtitle" class="subtitle">Questions about the project, the code, or the development process — I read everything.</p>

	<section class="section">
		<h2>Email</h2>
		<p>The fastest way to reach me: <a href="mailto:contact@qrak.org"><strong>contact@qrak.org</strong></a>. I typically reply within 1–2 business days.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2>Community & Code</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/qrak" target="_blank">github.com/qrak</a> — the full source lives in <a href="https://github.com/qrak/LLM_trader" target="_blank">qrak/LLM_trader</a></li>
			<li><strong>Discord:</strong> <a href="https://discord.gg/ZC48aTTqR2" target="_blank">join the community server</a> — build questions, bug reports, feature ideas</li>
			<li><strong>Live dashboard:</strong> <a href="https://semanticsignal.qrak.org" target="_blank">semanticsignal.qrak.org</a> — watch the bot's decisions in real time</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2>Support the Project</h2>
		<p>This is an open-source project built in spare time. If it's useful to you, you can <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/qrak" target="_blank">buy me a coffee</a>.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2>Business / Collaboration</h2>
		<p>For collaboration, sponsorship, or employment inquiries, please use <a href="mailto:contact@qrak.org">contact@qrak.org</a> with a clear subject line. I'm open to backend/AI engineering opportunities in Wrocław or remote.</p>
	</section>
</ArticleLayout>
